This crate is an unofficial Rust port of part of the following work.

Caffeine (https://github.com/ben-manes/caffeine), version 3.1.8, Copyright Ben Manes, Apache-2.0.
  The eviction policy (W-TinyLFU: admission window, probation and protected SLRU segments, the FrequencySketch
  admission filter and the hill climber) is ported from BoundedLocalCache.java and FrequencySketch.java. The
  upstream sources are pinned read-only in upstream/ (a git submodule), with their own LICENSE.
  tests/vectors/ holds output recorded from the published caffeine-3.1.8.jar by the programs in upstream-tools/.
  It is not part of the Caffeine project and is not endorsed by it.
